\end{comment}
\textcolor{blue}{\mbox{Table~\ref{tab:env_params}} summarizes the default constellation, workload, routing, and redeployment settings, whereas \mbox{Table~\ref{tab:learning_params}} lists the GNN and PPO parameters and the bandit parameters. The default configuration uses 180 satellites, service chains containing 5 to 15 microservices, a routing horizon of three slots, and a redeployment window of ten slots. These settings are fixed across the compared methods unless otherwise stated.}

